    "text": "A group G is said to be invariably generated by a and b if G is generated\nby the conjugates ag , bh for every g, h. Let p ̸= q be fixed primes. Does every finite\ngroup embed into a finite group invariably generated by an element of order p and an\nelement of order q?                                                     P. A. Zalesskii",
